  the whole thing: 4.0 s, 320 bytes of samples
  keeping 0.5s to 2.0s: 1.5 s, 120 bytes of samples
  and those bytes appear, unchanged, inside the original: fax
  the chunks it kept, by stamp: [160, 161]
