  from 2.0s to the end: 2.0 s
  from the start to 1.0s: 1.0 s
  no bounds at all keeps it whole: fax
  -- and the ones that must fail --
    an end before its start: SkillIssue -- the end of the cut is not after its start.
    a range past the song: SkillIssue -- that range does not cover a single frame of the song.
    cutting a file that still has video: SkillIssue -- cut the video out first -- this works on an audio-only file.
    cutting something that is not an MP4: SkillIssue -- there is no sound track in that file to cut.
